{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2022-01-10 00:01:00', 'title': "CHICAGO TAKES ANOTHER TOP SPOT FOR PESTS, THIS TIME RANKING #1 ON ORKIN'S BED BUG CITIES LIST", 'text': "ATLANTA, JAN. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHICAGO SETTLED IN FOR THE SECOND YEAR IN A ROW AS THE #1 CITY ON ORKIN'S 2022 TOP 50 BED BUG CITIES LIST, WITH PHILADELPHIA AND NEW YORK MOVING INTO THE SECOND AND THIRD PLACE SPOTS, RESPECTIVELY. THESE TWO NORTHEAST CITIES SAW THE LARGEST JUMPS WITH PHILADELPHIA MOVING UP 12 SPOTS AND NEW YORK MOVING UP NINE SPOTS."}